Patch 0089 (gen2_i -> build/gen2_j), 2026-11-26. Two default-off switches in CR_P0088, matched exactly ("all" does NOT enable them):
  pocketcells : enemy-half legality = inner bridge column only, no buildings on the bridge, bank corner cells closed, deploy-anywhere not in the river outside the walk corridor.
  kingpath    : a King-bound unit past the river, |x-8.5|<=3, King in sight, no standing tower on the segment, walks straight to the King instead of the lane waypoint.
Paths below start at engine/; apply from the build folder: cd build/gen2_X && patch -p1 < this. Also adds pocketcells/kingpath to p0088_active() (src/bindings.cpp).
Both off = bit-identical to gen2_i (see runs/pocket_1126/verify/VERIFY.txt section D).

